{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bread_loaf","model_identifier":"bread_loaf","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## bread_loaf\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 2 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.5..2.5, y -2.0..2.5, z -5.0..3.0 (size 5.0 x 4.5 x 8.0 u = 14 x 13 x 22 cm).\nBread loaf: an oval golden loaf (~28 cm) with a paler domed top slashed with three dark scores and a darker baked base; held round its middle. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 2.0.\n"},"description":"## bread_loaf\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 2 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.5..2.5, y -2.0..2.5, z -5.0..3.0 (size 5.0 x 4.5 x 8.0 u = 14 x 13 x 22 cm).\nBread loaf: an oval golden loaf (~28 cm) with a paler domed top slashed with three dark scores and a darker baked base; held round its middle. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 2.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"loaf","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.5,-2.0,-5.0],"to":[2.5,1.5,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8,8,13.0,11.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[18,0,26.0,3.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[13,8,18.0,11.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,8,8.0,11.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,5.0,8.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[5,0,10.0,8.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7f298052-ebaf-5001-9d8d-6b8a50c91d04"},{"name":"dome","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.0,1.5,-4.5],"to":[2.0,2.5,2.5